{"id":1821943,"retrievedAt":"2026-11-09T21:41:16.261Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[],"homepage":"","id":1821943,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Magnolias for Jonas","overview":"A film tribute to our friend Jonas Mekas. Re-working imagery from our 2005 work Drift, Leah Singer and I created this film to honor Jonas. First projected at a memorial evening not long after his passing in early 2019 at 96, with live accompaniment by me, it has been re-edited with a new soundtrack. It is being presented at Ki Smith Gallery, 2 locations in Manhattan, as part of the group exhibition To Jonas With Love.  Jonas was an inspiration to both of us, the model of a consumate artist, always inspirational! The original material is Leah's unique technique of 16mm film loaded and shot in a still camera and projected in special analyzer projectors at variable speeds, forward and reverse, a body of work that was in progress when we first met in 1989.","popularity":0,"poster_path":"/gjcrAJPBeY5czQvCLtFEuZorYiX.jpg","production_companies":[],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"2019-02-01","revenue":0,"runtime":7,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Magnolias for Jonas","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[],"crew":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":101843,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Lee Ranaldo","original_name":"Lee Ranaldo","popularity":0.367,"profile_path":"/c5nKR4iHOmYJBZTTQMNgqC14TFr.jpg","credit_id":"6af1ab9cd66a9f0036d58429","department":"Directing","job":"Director"},{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":4102103,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Leah Singer","original_name":"Leah Singer","popularity":0.0345,"profile_path":null,"credit_id":"6af1aba625fbfdd92e4bd0b5","department":"Directing","job":"Director"},{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":101843,"known